cted-(C11-Pad1)\", \"GND\"], \"observed\": \"C11 is a 0.1 uF capacitor (Device:C) but uses an inductor land-pattern footprint. Its pad 1 is unconnected and only pad 2 is on GND, so the part does nothing.\", \"expected\": \"A 0.1 uF capacitor should use a capacitor footprint and be connected between the intended supply and GND as a decoupling capacitor.\", \"evidence\": [{\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(ref \\\"C11\\\")\\n      (value \\\"0.1uF\\\")\\n      (footprint \\\"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\\\")\"}, {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"59\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(C11-Pad1)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\")\\n      (node (ref \\\"C11\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") (pintype \\\"passive\\\")))\"}], \"impact\": \"The part is a dead, unconnected capacitor with the wrong footprint. Any decoupling it was meant to provide is missing, and the land pattern is wrong for the part.\", \"confidence\": 0.3}], \"summary\": \"The netlist is largely consistent with the spec, but the SPICE deck's 25 V battery source is implausible for an 18650 cell feeding a 5.5 V-class regulator. There are also smaller issues with the C1 value and with the C11 footprint and open pad.\"}",
